<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en" data-low-data="<%= user?.preferences?.lowData ? 'true' : 'false' %>"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" name="viewport"/><meta content="Compare standard, express and pickup options before placing an order." name="description"/><meta content="#ff6200" name="theme-color"/><title>Shipping Information — Classic Mart</title><link href="/styles.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/storefront-pages.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/shared-shell.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/marketplace-pages.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/info-pages.css" rel="stylesheet"/></head><body class="info-body"><a class="skip-link" href="#mainContent">Skip to content</a><%- include("partials/storefront-header") %><main class="info-main" id="mainContent"><section class="info-hero"><div class="container"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="catalog-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span><strong>Shipping Information</strong></nav><span class="info-kicker">Delivery choices you can understand</span><h1>Shipping Information</h1><p>Compare standard, express and pickup options before placing an order.</p></div></section><div class="container info-content"><div class="info-grid three"><article><h2>Standard delivery</h2><p>Usually 3–5 business days. Free shipping applies only where the current country configuration and order subtotal qualify.</p></article><article><h2>Express delivery</h2><p>Usually 1–2 business days where supported, with an additional fee shown at checkout.</p></article><article><h2>Store pickup</h2><p>Available from participating sellers. Wait for the collection confirmation before travelling.</p></article></div><section class="info-section"><h2>Tracking</h2><p>Use the Track Order page with your order number. Confirmed orders display their real shipment state and delivery updates as custody progresses.</p></section></div><% if (typeof cmsContent !== 'undefined' && cmsContent) { %><section class="container info-section" style="margin-top:18px"><article style="border:1px solid #dbe4ef;border-radius:18px;padding:18px;background:#fff"><span class="info-kicker">Managed content · v<%= cmsContent.version %></span><h2><%= cmsContent.title %></h2><p style="white-space:pre-wrap"><%= cmsContent.body %></p></article></section><% } %></main><section class="newsletter">
<div class="container newsletter-inner">
<div class="newsletter-message"><span><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/envelope.svg"/></span><div><strong>Stay in the Loop!</strong><small>Get exclusive deals, new arrivals and shopping tips.</small></div></div>
<form class="newsletter-form" data-newsletter-form id="newsletterForm" novalidate>
<label class="sr-only" for="newsletterEmail">Email address</label>
<input autocomplete="email" id="newsletterEmail" maxlength="254" name="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" required type="email"/>
<button type="submit">Subscribe</button>
<p aria-live="polite" class="newsletter-status" data-newsletter-status></p>
</form>
<div class="newsletter-perks"><span><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/percent.svg"/><b>Exclusive Deals</b></span><span><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/gift.svg"/><b>New Arrivals</b></span><span><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/location-dot.svg"/><b>Shopping Tips</b></span></div>
</div>
</section><%- include("partials/storefront-footer") %><div aria-live="polite" class="page-toast" id="pageToast" role="status"></div><script src="/cart-store.js"></script>
<script src="/info-pages.js"></script><script src="/shared-shell.js"></script><script src="/image-fallback.js"></script><script src="/country-switcher.js"></script><script src="/search-tools.js"></script><script src="/newsletter.js"></script></body></html>